{"id":"zamechanie","lemma":"замечание","pos":"noun","rank":3667,"glosses":["remark, observation, criticism","reproof, rebuke, reprimand, talking-to, telling-off"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a6/Ru-%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%87%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%87%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"замечания","plural":"замечания"},"examples":[{"text":"Могу я сделать замечание?","en":"Can I make one observation?","words":[{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to make, to do"},null]},{"text":"Ваши замечания были неуместны.","en":"Your remarks were out of place.","words":[{"g":"your, yours","l":"ваш"},null,{"g":"were","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Кажется, его замечание не в тему.","en":"His remark seems to be off the point.","words":[{"g":"apparently, it seems"},{"g":"him / his"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Мои замечания были адресованы не вам.","en":"My remarks were not aimed at you.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"мой"},null,{"g":"were","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"вы"}]},{"text":"Ваше замечание неуместно.","en":"Your remark is irrelevant.","words":[{"g":"your, yours","l":"ваш"},null,null]}]}